 "verdict": "HORIZON DOES NOT RESCUE IT: the best cell anywhere is H=126 k=200 at -1.99%/yr, still negative. The edge does not grow with the holding period faster than the signal decays, so the 28-vs-35 bps problem is not a turnover problem. \u00a759 stands and the next move is a different INPUT, not a different holding rule.",
